OL,5,G0110 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FJunior, who's eight, has been
OL,7,     Fknocked off his bike by a car. He
OL,8,     Fhas an open leg fracture and
OL,9,     Fsuspected internal bleeding.
OL,10,     FMeanwhile, Anthony has a
OL,11,     Fdangerously high heart rate.
OL,12,G0215 999: On the Front Line
