OL,14,     Fcalled out to a cyclist crushed by
OL,15,     Fa lorry. In Coventry, paramedics
OL,16,     Frush to help a man who's fallen
OL,17,     Ffrom a barge and a baby in cardiac
OL,18,     Farrest.
